<title>MALAYSIA: Bridgecon still finalising acquisition.</title>
<headline>Bridgecon still finalising acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian civil engineering firm Bridgecon Bhd said that it is still finalising a proposed acquisition &quot;and other related transactions,&quot; and that an announcement would be made once the deals were finalised.</p>
<p>The company did not provide any details in a statement sent to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its stock has been suspended since September 9 for a news announcement, when it last traded at 19.00 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
